{"id":"n3-007","title":"～ないで","romaji":"〜naide","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"Express 'without doing ~' or 'without ~ing'.","longExplanation":"The ～ないで grammar point is used to express the idea of 'without doing something' or 'without ~ing' in English. It is formed by attaching the ない-form of the verb and adding で (de). This is used for expressing when an action is not taken or avoided, without interfering with the main action.","formation":"Verb-ない-form + で","examples":[{"jp":"会わないでその電話をかけました。","romaji":"Awanai de sono denwa wo kakemashita.","en":"I made the phone call without meeting them.","words":[{"surface":"会わ","vocabId":"1198180","reading":"あう","baseForm":"会う"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"電話","vocabId":"1443840","reading":"でんわ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"かけ","vocabId":"1590040","reading":"かけ","baseForm":"かける"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2]},{"jp":"雨が降るのを待たないで、家を出ました。","romaji":"Ame ga furu no wo matanai de, ie wo demashita.","en":"I left the house without waiting for it to rain.","words":[{"surface":"雨","vocabId":"1171900","reading":"あめ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"降る","vocabId":"1282790","reading":"ふる"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"待た","vocabId":"1410590","reading":"まつ","baseForm":"待つ"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"家","vocabId":"1191730","reading":"いえ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"出","vocabId":"1896380","reading":"で","baseForm":"出る"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7]},{"jp":"誰にも聞かないで、その秘密を知りました。","romaji":"Dare ni mo kikanai de, sono himitsu wo shirimashita.","en":"I found out the secret without asking anyone.","words":[{"surface":"誰","vocabId":"1416830","reading":"だれ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"聞か","vocabId":"1591110","reading":"きく","baseForm":"聞く"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"秘密","vocabId":"1484150","reading":"ひみつ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"知り","vocabId":"1420470","reading":"しる","baseForm":"知る"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5]},{"jp":"遅れることを知らないで、駅に向かいました。","romaji":"Okureru koto wo shiranai de, eki ni mukaimashita.","en":"I headed to the station without knowing I was late.","words":[{"surface":"遅れる","vocabId":"1589040","reading":"おくれる"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"知ら","vocabId":"1420470","reading":"しる","baseForm":"知る"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"駅","vocabId":"1175140","reading":"えき"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"向かい","vocabId":"1604800","reading":"むかう","baseForm":"向かう"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5]}]}